175
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:30,335
So this takes care of
traversing your graph for you.

176
00:07:30,335 --> 00:07:31,210
It takes care of you.

177
00:07:31,210 --> 00:07:35,310
You don't need to write
Dijkstra's by hand.

178
00:07:35,310 --> 00:07:37,680
