the traversal for you.

179
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:41,270
And basically, what it says
is, I want all of the paths

180
00:07:41,270 --> 00:07:43,770
from one node to another.

181
00:07:43,770 --> 00:07:47,280
So the shortest one
or the data you want,

182
00:07:47,280 --> 00:07:49,950
