v4 to v6, and v6 to v5,

198
00:08:23,940 --> 00:08:24,990
what is that path?

199
00:08:24,990 --> 00:08:27,410
Well, I need to add
up all of these edges.

200
00:08:27,410 --> 00:08:30,170
OK, well, the edges are
going to be 2 plus 6 plus 1,

201
00:08:30,170 --> 00:08:32,539
so that's going to be 9.

202
00:08:32,539 --> 00:08:33,923
All right, it sums them up.

203
00:08:33,923 --> 00:08:36,090
So back to the code, that's
exactly what it's doing.

204
00:08:36,090 --> 00:08:37,980
I have a pathway
that starts at 0.

205
00:08:37,980 --> 00:08:40,250
I loop through all
of the edges here.

206
00:08:40,250 --> 00:08:43,549
And then I add them up, and then
I print out what the pathway is.

207
00:08:43,549 --> 00:08:45,230
Let me point out one--

